{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GE8ptAgrAQB7vqQwR9uVZs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VP9xFVr6kYtEd6egb8G8Xn","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista/.vista/ralph/arch-chat-build-5d505475/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","old_string":"| Step | Phase | Files | Dependencies | Effort |\n|------|-------|-------|-------------|--------|\n| 1 | Phase 1 | `service_lifecycle.py` | None | Medium |\n| 2 | Phase 1 | `routes/service_status.py`, `config.py` changes | Step 1 | Small |\n| 3 | Phase 1 | `app.py` lifespan changes | Steps 1-2 | Small |\n| 4 | Phase 3 | `diagram_watcher.py` rewrite | `watchdog` package | Medium |\n| 5 | Phase 4 | `context_assembler.py` | None | Small |\n| 6 | Phase 2 | `claude_ws_client.py` | `websockets`, `httpx`, Step 1 | Large |\n| 7 | Phase 2 | `opencode_client.py` | `httpx`, Step 1 | Medium |\n| 8 | Phase 2 | `provider_router.py` | Steps 6+7 | Medium |\n| 9 | Phase 2 | `chat_service.py` rewrite, `chat_sessions.py` update | Steps 5+8 | Medium |\n| 10 | Phase 5 | `provider_service.py` model discovery | Steps 1+7 | Small |\n| 11 | Phase 6 | `architecture.html` frontend changes | Steps 1+9 | Medium |\n| 12 | Phase 7 | Companion fork verification + Bun check | Step 1 | Small |\n| 13 | Phase 8 | Final integration, `mcp_server.py` cleanup | All above | Medium |","new_string":"| Step | Phase | Files | Dependencies | Effort | Status |\n|------|-------|-------|-------------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Phase 1 | `service_lifecycle.py` | None | Medium | DONE |\n| 2 | Phase 1 | `routes/service_status.py`, `config.py` changes | Step 1 | Small | DONE |\n| 3 | Phase 1 | `app.py` lifespan changes | Steps 1-2 | Small | DONE |\n| 4 | Phase 3 | `diagram_watcher.py` rewrite | `watchdog` package | Medium | DEFERRED |\n| 5 | Phase 4 | `context_assembler.py` | None | Small | DONE |\n| 6 | Phase 2 | `claude_ws_client.py` | `websockets`, `httpx`, Step 1 | Large | DONE |\n| 7 | Phase 2 | `opencode_client.py` | `httpx`, Step 1 | Medium | DONE |\n| 8 | Phase 2 | `provider_router.py` | Steps 6+7 | Medium | DONE |\n| 9 | Phase 2 | `chat_service.py` rewrite, `chat_sessions.py` update | Steps 5+8 | Medium | DONE |\n| 10 | Phase 5 | `provider_service.py` model discovery | Steps 1+7 | Small | DONE |\n| 11 | Phase 6 | `architecture.html` frontend changes | Steps 1+9 | Medium | DONE |\n| 12 | Phase 7 | Companion fork verification + Bun check | Step 1 | Small | DONE |\n| 13 | Phase 8 | Final integration, `mcp_server.py` cleanup | All above | Medium | PARTIAL |"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":833,"cache_read_input_tokens":154646,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":833},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fe920b97-a686-4daa-9f39-67e009025eb9","uuid":"148b5064-b2b8-4807-84a2-99eaf27c9976"}
